b/u/c check them and try stacking them.  Once all of your candles
are uncursed they'll form two stacks if you have enough to ensure
at least one of both kinds.  Same deal as stacking hard blue gems
to determine if there are more than one kind (sapphires are
always hard blue, aquamarine either hard blue or hard green IIRC).
If they were the exact same type of candle, they'd stack together.
Also if you're carrying a candle when you get the ID-everything
effect of a blessed ?oID, you'll be told which type you're
carrying.

Once folks learn what candles are really for, they usually start
hoarding their candles until they have more than enough.  It's
better to have twice as many candles as needed than to have one
too few.  So once you've leaned about the bottom of the dungeon
you lose interest in how long any one candle will burn in a dark
room, and the difference between the two types becomes irrelevant
and the whole ID issue becomes an also-ran game.

